# GMS: a 10+4x% chance of one meso every time you attack, over 5 levels, up to
# 15 on the ground. Ten levels here at 2% apiece, which lands on GMS's 30%.
#
# The roll is per LINE the swing lands on an enemy. GMS never says so outright,
# but four coins off a single monster from one attack cannot happen any other
# way, and it is what makes the pair worth its thirty points.
#
# What a meso is worth is not modelled, and GMS does not state it either: its
# own hyper enhancement raises the chance and the count and never a value. A
# meso is ammunition for Meso Explosion, which spends it.
name: "Pick Pocket"
description: "Causes Mesos to drop when you attack with your skills."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CHIEF_BANDIT skill_order: 4 }
max_level: 10
base { meso_drop_chance: 0.12 }
per_level { meso_drop_chance: 0.02 }
